{"3166860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Aye Aye Captain!", "steam_appid": 3166860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4752260], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166860/extras/3dd2b48f0ab531aa1f62d1e6cf35644b.avif?t=1784620340\" width=600 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166860/extras/38ca0849ce355cb8a74d0a941279961f.poster.avif?t=1784620340\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166860/extras/38ca0849ce355cb8a74d0a941279961f.webm?t=1784620340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166860/extras/38ca0849ce355cb8a74d0a941279961f.mp4?t=1784620340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aye Aye Captain is a chaotic co-op pirate game for one to four players. Working as a team, you and your fellow crews must prepare your cannons, clean and repair your pirate ship, fight with enemies and stay away from bottom of deep dark ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ocean is teeming with hidden treasures, but being a pirate it requires serious teamwork. One moment you are frantically running around the deck patching leaks and loading cannons, and the next you are drawing your cutlass to brawl with rival pirates who just swung aboard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166860/extras/efb412e022f4055a0683ce3ba0cd6ae3.avif?t=1784620340\" width=600 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166860/extras/9676e284da217eb8efa580036d0c080e.poster.avif?t=1784620340\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166860/extras/9676e284da217eb8efa580036d0c080e.webm?t=1784620340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166860/extras/9676e284da217eb8efa580036d0c080e.mp4?t=1784620340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ocean is full of surprises! Each stage introduces fresh environmental hazards, escalating brawls, and unexpected pirate chores. You will need tight coordination and constant communication with your mateys to conquer the chaos and advance to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166860/extras/9c9f3bf29285a8cebd4e15fe09a4e81e.avif?t=1784620340\" width=600 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166860/extras/82545c1a9f0f182eb92e17e5bb82a107.poster.avif?t=1784620340\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166860/extras/82545c1a9f0f182eb92e17e5bb82a107.webm?t=1784620340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166860/extras/82545c1a9f0f182eb92e17e5bb82a107.mp4?t=1784620340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or gather up to three friends for online multiplayer and local multiplyer. Divide the roles or just run around the world. Adventure calls the crew.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166860/extras/3dd2b48f0ab531aa1f62d1e6cf35644b.avif?t=1784620340\" width=600 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166860/extras/38ca0849ce355cb8a74d0a941279961f.poster.avif?t=1784620340\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166860/extras/38ca0849ce355cb8a74d0a941279961f.webm?t=1784620340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166860/extras/38ca0849ce355cb8a74d0a941279961f.mp4?t=1784620340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aye Aye Captain is a chaotic co-op pirate game for one to four players. Working as a team, you and your fellow crews must prepare your cannons, clean and repair your pirate ship, fight with enemies and stay away from bottom of deep dark ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ocean is teeming with hidden treasures, but being a pirate it requires serious teamwork. One moment you are frantically running around the deck patching leaks and loading cannons, and the next you are drawing your cutlass to brawl with rival pirates who just swung aboard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"